The protocol table's patch rules: a property whose omission, null and value
mean unchanged, cleared and replaced becomes a Patch of its type, a string, an
array and an object here, read and sent in all three states
(0021-PLAN-resolve-issues-4-and-5-before-v1-14-0.md, step 2).

